/-- **The representatives of `ν Antiprism.EnneagonalAntiprism.polyhedron`**: the same system, each with exactly one root, at the scale `ν Antiprism.EnneagonalAntiprism.polyhedron`. -/
theorem prismEnneagonalAntiprism_nu_reps_list :
    PolynomialSystem.IsRootEq [prismEnneagonalAntiprism_nu_system_0] Antiprism.EnneagonalAntiprism.polyhedron.nieuwland :=
